<h3>Results</h3>

<p>IT Load: <span id="itLoad">-</span> kW</p>

<p>Wet Bulb Temperature: <span id="wetBulb">-</span> °C</p>

<p>Supply Air Temperature: <span id="supplyTemp">-</span> °C</p>

<p>Required Airflow: <span id="airflow">-</span> m³/s</p>

<p>Water Consumption: <span id="waterUse">-</span> m³/h</p>

<p>PUE Estimate: <span id="pue">-</span></p>

</div>

